# A small new database: a header and three batches, each with its marker.
# At the end it holds four tables:
# - docs, with the fields title, vec, note and score, vectors of 2 values, and
#   the record docs:1, whose note was cleared, so no record holds a note;
# - pics, with the field vec and vectors of 3 values, but no records;
# - users, with the field name and the records users:ann and users:bob;
# - users2, with the field name and the record users2:zed.
# Links go from users:ann and from users2:zed to docs:1.
# See beta/FORMAT.md. Every fixture uses the database ID 0123456789abcdef fedcba9876543210.

48 43 52 58 0d 0a 1a 0a                           # header: magic number, "HCRX" then CR, LF, Ctrl-Z, LF
01 00 00 00                                       # format version: 1
01 23 45 67 89 ab cd ef fe dc ba 98 76 54 32 10   # database ID
01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00                           # generation: 1
00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00                           # continues from: generation, 0 in generation 1
00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00                           # continues from: sequence number, 0
00 00 00 00                                       # continues from: checksum, 0
00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00                           # compacted part ends: 0, nothing compacted
8d 4b 39 d3                                       # header checksum: 0xd3394b8d, the CRC32C of bytes 0 to 63

# Batch 1: a table, two records and a link.
48 43 52 42                                       # batch: magic number "HCRB"
01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00                           # generation: 1
90 00 00 00 00 00 00 00                           # length: 144 bytes
01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00                           # sequence number: 1
54                                                # T: create a table
04 00                                             # table name: 4 bytes
64 6f 63 73                                       # docs
00 00 00 00                                       # vector size: 0, none yet
00 00                                             # fields: 0
50                                                # P: put fields
06 00                                             # key: 6 bytes
64 6f 63 73 3a 31                                 # docs:1
02 00                                             # fields: 2
05 00                                             # field name: 5 bytes
74 69 74 6c 65                                    # title
74 05 00 00 00                                    # t: text, 5 bytes
46 69 72 73 74                                    # First
03 00                                             # field name: 3 bytes
76 65 63                                          # vec
76 02 00 00 00                                    # v: vector, 2 values
9a 99 19 3f                                       # 0.6
cd cc 4c 3f                                       # 0.8
50                                                # P: put fields
06 00                                             # key: 6 bytes
64 6f 63 73 3a 32                                 # docs:2
01 00                                             # fields: 1
05 00                                             # field name: 5 bytes
74 69 74 6c 65                                    # title
74 06 00 00 00                                    # t: text, 6 bytes
53 65 63 6f 6e 64                                 # Second
4c                                                # L: add a link
06 00                                             # from: 6 bytes
64 6f 63 73 3a 32                                 # docs:2
05 00                                             # type: 5 bytes
63 69 74 65 73                                    # cites
06 00                                             # to: 6 bytes
64 6f 63 73 3a 31                                 # docs:1
7e ba d0 1e                                       # checksum: 0x1ed0ba7e, the CRC32C of the 140 bytes before it
48 43 52 4d                                       # marker: magic number "HCRM"
01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00                           # the batch's sequence number: 1
7e ba d0 1e                                       # the batch's checksum: 0x1ed0ba7e
8a 3a 6d dd                                       # check value: 0xdd6d3a8a, the CRC32C of the database ID, generation 1 and the 16 bytes before it

